Specifications and data
-----------------------

W3C XML Schema 1.0 (Part 1: Structures, Part 2: Datatypes, Second
Edition, with its errata), Extensible Markup Language (XML) 1.0 Fifth
Edition and XML Path Language 1.0 are W3C recommendations; their
structure and rules are implemented in our own words and code. No text is
reproduced; the schema for schema documents is restated as our own
tables (s4s.go), not copied. The XML name character ranges in simple.go
and regexclass.go are facts taken from XML 1.0 Fifth Edition.

The Unicode block ranges in regex.go are facts taken from the Unicode
Character Database (Blocks.txt, Unicode 3.1), Copyright Unicode, Inc.,
under the Unicode License.

