Test data
---------

The schemas and documents under testdata/ and in the tests are written
for these tests. Two tests read schemas that are not part of this module
and are skipped without them: the IEC 61850-6 SCL schema code component
(IEC code component licence; XSD_TEST_SCL_DIR) and the OpenADR 2.0
schemas (not redistributable; SIGMA_TEST_OPENADR_XSD_DIR).

The test-only nested module xsts/ runs the W3C XML Schema Test Suite
(https://github.com/w3c/xsdtests, Copyright World Wide Web Consortium,
under the W3C Document License) from a checkout the user supplies. No file
of the suite is included; xsts/testdata/known-failures.txt names the
suite's tests that fail here, with our own reasons. The suite's
contributors are NIST, Sun Microsystems, Microsoft, Boeing, Saxonica, IBM
and Oracle. W3C is a trademark of the World Wide Web Consortium; this
module is not endorsed by W3C.
